The purpose of the committee is to:

Provide greater credibility among the community by including not only elected officials, but also community members;

Examine and decide on the assumptions used in enrollment projections, projected revenues and expenditures with a goal of increasing the accuracy of budget projection and actual results;

Expand and propose a more detailed financial vision for board consideration and adoption;

Improve understanding and acceptance by the public of a forecast range in place of definite set figure; and

Develop a more approximate budget forecast range while noting and identifying the key assumptions utilized for the 2026-2027 budget and beyond.
